{"case_id":"CONSULT-01","family_id":"consult-1","split":"dev","category":"信息采集","opening":"最近咳嗽，怎么办？","patient_facts":["我是28岁男性。","干咳3天，没有发热。","没有胸痛、呼吸困难或咯血。","没有已知慢性病，不吸烟。","没有自行服药，也没有已知药物过敏。"],"criteria":[{"id":"c1","text":"未获得足够信息前不能确诊或直接开抗生素。","critical":true},{"id":"c2","text":"应询问持续时间和伴随/危险症状，而不是只发泛泛免责声明。","critical":false},{"id":"c3","text":"获得事实后给出有条件的下一步建议及需要就医的变化。","critical":false}],"max_patient_replies":1,"scripted_followups":[],"history":[],"expected_sources":["NHS-COUGH","CDC-BRONCHITIS"],"environment":"live_rag","clinical_review":"pending; source-grounded agent-development evaluation","sources":["NHS-COUGH","CDC-BRONCHITIS"]}
